abstract: >-
  An AI-powered toolkit for the University of Leeds AIRE high-performance
  computing cluster: shell tools, an MCP server and agent configuration for
  Claude Code, Codex and the Gemini CLI, covering Slurm job submission, module
  handling and PyTorch environments.
